id: master-of-openings
name: Master of Openings
talentCategory: counter
prerequisites: Exploit Expert
description: >
  You are so skilled at taking advantage of openings in your enemy’s guard that you create openings where none were before.
text: >
  Master of Openings: You are so skilled at taking advantage of openings in your enemy’s guard that you create openings where none were before.
  –Prerequisites: Exploit Expert
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Strike Rolls for Attacking Maneuvers made through the Exploit Maneuver by 1(T).
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If an Opponent uses the Power Up Maneuver or Transformation Maneuver while not at Long Range, this triggers your Exploit Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# (1) An attack made through the Exploit (chat.mjs strikeParts).
strike.viaExploit += 1(T);
# (2) An Opponent not at Long Range using the Power Up or the Transformation Maneuver: the Exploit at them, out of sequence, on
# its card - taken, once a Round (chat.mjs openingsOffers).
allow exploit.onPowerUp;
